{"id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md","title":"ZFC Partial Order","display":"df-zfc-partial-order — ZFC Partial Order","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-partial-order","aliases":["58-df-zfc-partial-order","58-df-zfc-order6-partial-order","58-df-zfc-poset-partial-order"],"display":"df-zfc-partial-order — ZFC Partial Order","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-partial-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-partial-order</span><span>58-df-zfc-order6-partial-order</span><span>58-df-zfc-poset-partial-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-partial-order — ZFC Partial Order"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (carrier set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq X\\times X\">\\(R\\subseteq X\\times X\\)</span> (binary relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S\\)</span> (canonical predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6PartialOrder}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcPosetPartialOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6PartialOrder}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcPosetPartialOrder}_S\\)</span> (aliases defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}partial\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(X,R)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq X\\times X\n\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\langle x,x\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\n\\to x=y\n\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in R\n\\to\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in R\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}partial\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(X,R)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq X\\times X\n\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\langle x,x\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\n\\to x=y\n\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in R\n\\to\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in R\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}partial\\text{-}order\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(X,R)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(X,R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}partial\\text{-}order\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(X,R)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(X,R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order6\\text{-}partial\\text{-}order\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6PartialOrder}_S(X,R)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(X,R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order6\\text{-}partial\\text{-}order\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6PartialOrder}_S(X,R)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(X,R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}partial\\text{-}order\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetPartialOrder}_S(X,R)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(X,R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}partial\\text{-}order\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetPartialOrder}_S(X,R)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(X,R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>All three historical aliases now share one pair-coded relation representation and one typed carrier.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq X\\times X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6PartialOrder}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcPosetPartialOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}partial\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(X,R)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq X\\times X\n\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\langle x,x\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\n\\to x=y\n\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in R\n\\to\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in R\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}partial\\text{-}order\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(X,R)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(X,R).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order6\\text{-}partial\\text{-}order\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6PartialOrder}_S(X,R)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(X,R).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}partial\\text{-}order\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPosetPartialOrder}_S(X,R)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(X,R).","display":true}],"bytes":1702,"backlinks":[{"id":"41c98c330a42b4cb","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S$ (partial-order predicate from [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]])"},{"id":"caa9b22df1480436","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"99debf16429f3448","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d7a16fc445b65679","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5190d793d205578e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"972ac6dc74ca9b9b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4e0fb35e7cde9e6b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b81ca8392ded6879","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4f30b85915c0f170","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c56721befebba903","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_